Thimsy OS console pictures

Each picture in images/ is listed below with the photo(s) it is made from,
each photo's author and licence, and the licence of the picture itself. The
photos are from Wikimedia Commons. Thimsy OS cut each subject out of its
photo, scaled and placed it on a transparent 1080x1080 canvas with a soft
floor shadow and, where a screen shows, filled the screen with an original
pixel scene of its own.

- Where a source photo is under CC BY-SA, the picture is offered under that
  same CC BY-SA licence.
- Otherwise Thimsy OS's work in the picture is by the Thimsy OS project,
  licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
  International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0), with the photo credits kept: credit
  "Console picture by the Thimsy OS project", plus the photo's credit.
- Public-domain and CC0 photos are credited as a courtesy.
- elektor.webp is a stand-in: no freely licensed photo of the Elektor TV
  Games Computer was found, so it shows a home-built microcomputer from an
  Elektor design of 1977 (an SC/MP system, per the photo's file name).

The theme metadata in metadata-global/ and metadata-custom/ is by the Thimsy
OS project, CC BY-NC 4.0. mods/console-pictures/sources.json in the Thimsy OS
repository holds the same per-picture data as this file.

